                    <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">• No harassment or abuse</li>
                    <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">• No unauthorized access to other accounts</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            
            <div style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
